// ProofOfAttention — the core primitive.
// Interface sketch; implementation lands with the Compact toolchain.
//
// submitAttentionProof(
//     listenerCommitment,   // private: listener identity stays hidden
//     segmentId,            // segment binding
//     challengeId,          // challenge binding
//     resultProof           // non-replayable proof payload
// )
//
// Proves: a valid listener satisfied the challenge for this specific segment.
//
// Private state: listener identity, answer, session info, interaction data.
// Public state:  aggregate verified attention, segment verification status.
